g15daemon 3.1.2 buster; urgency=low
 * BugFix: Config values containing ":" or "=" no longer truncated
 * BugFix: Keyboard unplug or a static screen no longer trips the systemd watchdog
 * BugFix: Clean shutdown with clients connected
 * BugFix: Client disconnects can no longer kill the daemon via SIGPIPE
 * BugFix: Races between key presses, redraws and client disconnects
 * Change: Simultaneous TCP clients limited to MAX_CLIENTS (10)
 * BugFix: uinput plugin no longer regains root at runtime

g15daemon 3.1.1 buster; urgency=low
 * BugFix: Digital clock colon and digit spacing
 * Change: Repeat popup registrations logged at INFO instead of NOTICE
 * Change: Clearer client connection count in systemd status
 * Change: Backlight only set at startup when configured; real levels read back (needs libg15 3.0.9)
 * Feature: LCD backlight switched off at system poweroff/reboot (logind plugin)
 * Change: Idle only darkens the LCD backlight; keyboard backlight left to UPower/systemd-backlight (also the light key)

g15daemon 3.1 buster; urgency=low
 * Feature: Global backlight and logind idle-monitor plugin (replaces g15dpms-monitor)
 * Feature: Screen priority and return to previous screen on disconnect
 * Feature: Client identification by process name, systemd sd_notify status/watchdog
 * Feature: Clock plugin L2 digital/digital+seconds/analog, locale-driven 12/24h with config override, seconds bar
 * BugFix: Concurrency, memory and return-value fixes, conf written before the client list is freed

g15daemon 3.0.2 buster; urgency=low
 * BugFix: Updated config.guess and config.sub. Thanks  Nicolas F. (@CounterPillow)

g15daemon 3.0.1 buster; urgency=low
 * BugFix: Removed AC PREREQ
 * Documentation: Changed some information in READMEs

g15daemon 3.0 buster; urgency=low
 * Code revamp

